LICENCE FOR THE REDISTRIBUTED MODEL WEIGHTS

  Model:  BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
  Author: BAAI (Beijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence)
  Source: https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

The author licenses this model under the MIT License. That licence is declared
in the model card's metadata at the address above, which is the authoritative
statement and is cited here as such:

    license: mit

The upstream repository publishes no LICENSE file and no copyright line, so
none is reproduced here rather than inventing one. The terms the author has
declared are the MIT terms, reproduced in full below, and those terms permit
modification and redistribution.

The weights redistributed here are MODIFIED: converted from the author's
`model.safetensors` to GGUF at F16. That is a container change and a
float32-to-float16 cast; nothing is retrained, pruned or otherwise altered.
The conversion is byte-reproducible and its recipe travels with the artifact at
dependencyskills/encoder/RECIPE.md, so the derivation is checkable rather than
asserted.

